        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml \&quot;Diagrama de Uso General - Elige tu Futuro\&quot;\nleft to right direction\nskinparam packageStyle rectangle\nskinparam actorStyle awesome\n\n&#39; ============================================\n&#39; ESTILOS VISUALES\n&#39; ============================================\nskinparam usecaseBackgroundColor #E8F4FD\nskinparam usecaseBorderColor #2C3E50\nskinparam actorBackgroundColor #2C3E50\nskinparam actorBorderColor #2C3E50\nskinparam actorFontColor white\n\n&#39; ============================================\n&#39; ACTORES\n&#39; ============================================\nactor \&quot;Estudiante\&quot; as Estudiante\nactor \&quot;Administrador\&quot; as Admin\n\n&#39; ============================================\n&#39; CASOS DE USO - AUTENTICACIÓN (Compartidos)\n&#39; ============================================\nrectangle \&quot;Autenticación y Acceso al Sistema\&quot; {\n  \n  usecase \&quot;Iniciar Sesión\&quot; as UC01\n  usecase \&quot;Registrarse\&quot; as UC02\n  usecase \&quot;Recuperar Contraseña\&quot; as UC03\n  usecase \&quot;Cerrar Sesión\&quot; as UC04\n  \n}\n\n&#39; ============================================\n&#39; CASOS DE USO - ESTUDIANTE\n&#39; ============================================\nrectangle \&quot;Módulos del Estudiante\&quot; {\n  \n  usecase \&quot;Acceder a Módulos Estudiante\&quot; as UC05\n  \n  usecase \&quot;Buscar Carreras\&quot; as UC06\n  usecase \&quot;Visualizar Ficha de Carrera\&quot; as UC07\n  usecase \&quot;Comparar Carreras\&quot; as UC08\n  usecase \&quot;Realizar Test Vocacional\&quot; as UC09\n  usecase \&quot;Consultar Mapa Educativo\&quot; as UC10\n  usecase \&quot;Gestionar Perfil\&quot; as UC11\n  usecase \&quot;Visualizar Dashboard Estudiante\&quot; as UC12\n  usecase \&quot;Ver Resultados de Tests\&quot; as UC13\n  \n}\n\n&#39; ============================================\n&#39; CASOS DE USO - ADMINISTRADOR\n&#39; ============================================\nrectangle \&quot;Módulos del Administrador\&quot; {\n  \n  usecase \&quot;Acceder a Administración\&quot; as UC14\n  usecase \&quot;Administrar Usuarios\&quot; as UC15\n  usecase \&quot;Administrar Estadísticas\&quot; as UC16\n  usecase \&quot;Visualizar Dashboard Administrativo\&quot; as UC17\n  usecase \&quot;Ver Reportes Generales\&quot; as UC18\n  usecase \&quot;Gestionar Contenido\&quot; as UC19\n  \n}\n\n&#39; ============================================\n&#39; RELACIONES DEL ESTUDIANTE\n&#39; ============================================\n\n&#39; Autenticación (sin login requerido)\nEstudiante --&gt; UC02\nEstudiante --&gt; UC03\nEstudiante --&gt; UC01\nEstudiante --&gt; UC04\n\n&#39; Acceso a módulos (requiere login)\nEstudiante --&gt; UC05\nUC05 ..&gt; UC01 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n\n&#39; Dashboard incluye acceso a módulos\nUC12 ..&gt; UC05 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n\n&#39; Módulos del estudiante (requieren acceso)\nUC05 ..&gt; UC06 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC05 ..&gt; UC07 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC05 ..&gt; UC08 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC05 ..&gt; UC09 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC05 ..&gt; UC10 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC05 ..&gt; UC11 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC05 ..&gt; UC12 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC05 ..&gt; UC13 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n\n&#39; Relaciones entre funcionalidades\nUC13 ..&gt; UC09 : &lt;&lt;extend&gt;&gt;\n\n&#39; ============================================\n&#39; RELACIONES DEL ADMINISTRADOR\n&#39; ============================================\n\n&#39; Autenticación (sin login requerido)\nAdmin --&gt; UC02\nAdmin --&gt; UC03\nAdmin --&gt; UC01\nAdmin --&gt; UC04\n\n&#39; Acceso a administración (requiere login)\nAdmin --&gt; UC14\nUC14 ..&gt; UC01 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n\n&#39; Módulos del administrador (requieren acceso)\nUC14 ..&gt; UC15 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC14 ..&gt; UC16 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC14 ..&gt; UC17 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC14 ..&gt; UC18 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC14 ..&gt; UC19 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n\n&#39; Relaciones entre funcionalidades\nUC17 ..&gt; UC14 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC18 ..&gt; UC16 : &lt;&lt;extend&gt;&gt;\n\n&#39; ============================================\n&#39; RESTRICCIONES Y NOTAS\n&#39; ============================================\nnote top of UC01\n  **Requisito obligatorio:**\n  Todos los usuarios deben\n  iniciar sesión para acceder\n  a cualquier funcionalidad\nend note\n\n&#39; ============================================\n&#39; LEYENDA\n&#39; ============================================\nlegend right\n  | &lt;back:#E3F2FD&gt;    &lt;/back&gt; | Casos de uso del Estudiante |\n  | &lt;back:#FCE4EC&gt;    &lt;/back&gt; | Casos de uso del Administrador |\n  | &lt;back:#FFF3E0&gt;    &lt;/back&gt; | Casos de uso de Autenticación |\n  | &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt; | Inclusión obligatoria |\n  | &lt;&lt;extend&gt;&gt; | Extensión opcional |\nendlegend\n\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;format&quot;: &quot;svg&quot;&#xa;}" id="Bd8ufhdo4DP_F7q5JvYX-1">
          <mxCell parent="1" style="shape=image;noLabel=1;verticalAlign=top;aspect=fixed;imageAspect=0;image=data:image/svg+xml,;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry height="1824" width="1084" x="90" y="3850" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml \&quot;Diagrama de Uso General - Elige tu Futuro\&quot;\nleft to right direction\nskinparam packageStyle rectangle\nskinparam actorStyle awesome\n\n&#39; ============================================\n&#39; ESTILOS VISUALES - COLORES\n&#39; ============================================\nskinparam usecaseBackgroundColor&lt;&lt;Estudiante&gt;&gt; #D4E6F1\nskinparam usecaseBorderColor&lt;&lt;Estudiante&gt;&gt; #1A5276\nskinparam usecaseBackgroundColor&lt;&lt;Administrador&gt;&gt; #FADBD8\nskinparam usecaseBorderColor&lt;&lt;Administrador&gt;&gt; #78281F\nskinparam usecaseBackgroundColor&lt;&lt;Autenticacion&gt;&gt; #FDEBD0\nskinparam usecaseBorderColor&lt;&lt;Autenticacion&gt;&gt; #935116\nskinparam usecaseBackgroundColor default #F4F6F7\nskinparam usecaseBorderColor default #2C3E50\n\n&#39; ============================================\n&#39; ACTORES (Estilo simplificado)\n&#39; ============================================\nactor \&quot;Estudiante\&quot; as Estudiante\nactor \&quot;Administrador\&quot; as Admin\n\n&#39; ============================================\n&#39; CASOS DE USO - AUTENTICACIÓN\n&#39; ============================================\nrectangle \&quot;Autenticación y Acceso al Sistema\&quot; {\n  \n  usecase \&quot;Iniciar Sesión\&quot; as LOG &lt;&lt;Autenticacion&gt;&gt;\n  usecase \&quot;Registrarse\&quot; as REG &lt;&lt;Autenticacion&gt;&gt;\n  usecase \&quot;Recuperar Contraseña\&quot; as REC &lt;&lt;Autenticacion&gt;&gt;\n  usecase \&quot;Cerrar Sesión\&quot; as CERR &lt;&lt;Autenticacion&gt;&gt;\n  \n}\n\n&#39; ============================================\n&#39; CASOS DE USO - ESTUDIANTE\n&#39; ============================================\nrectangle \&quot;Módulos del Estudiante\&quot; {\n  \n  usecase \&quot;Acceder a Módulos Estudiante\&quot; as ACC_E &lt;&lt;Estudiante&gt;&gt;\n  \n  usecase \&quot;Buscar Carreras\&quot; as BUS &lt;&lt;Estudiante&gt;&gt;\n  usecase \&quot;Visualizar Ficha de Carrera\&quot; as FIC &lt;&lt;Estudiante&gt;&gt;\n  usecase \&quot;Comparar Carreras\&quot; as COM &lt;&lt;Estudiante&gt;&gt;\n  usecase \&quot;Realizar Test Vocacional\&quot; as TES &lt;&lt;Estudiante&gt;&gt;\n  usecase \&quot;Ver Resultados de Tests\&quot; as RES &lt;&lt;Estudiante&gt;&gt;\n  usecase \&quot;Consultar Mapa Educativo\&quot; as MAP &lt;&lt;Estudiante&gt;&gt;\n  usecase \&quot;Gestionar Perfil\&quot; as PER &lt;&lt;Estudiante&gt;&gt;\n  usecase \&quot;Visualizar Dashboard Estudiante\&quot; as DASH &lt;&lt;Estudiante&gt;&gt;\n  \n}\n\n&#39; ============================================\n&#39; CASOS DE USO - ADMINISTRADOR\n&#39; ============================================\nrectangle \&quot;Módulos del Administrador\&quot; {\n  \n  usecase \&quot;Acceder a Administración\&quot; as ACC_A &lt;&lt;Administrador&gt;&gt;\n  usecase \&quot;Administrar Usuarios\&quot; as ADM_USR &lt;&lt;Administrador&gt;&gt;\n  usecase \&quot;Administrar Estadísticas\&quot; as ADM_EST &lt;&lt;Administrador&gt;&gt;\n  usecase \&quot;Visualizar Dashboard Administrativo\&quot; as DASH_ADM &lt;&lt;Administrador&gt;&gt;\n  usecase \&quot;Ver Reportes Generales\&quot; as REP &lt;&lt;Administrador&gt;&gt;\n  usecase \&quot;Gestionar Contenido\&quot; as GES &lt;&lt;Administrador&gt;&gt;\n  \n}\n\n&#39; ============================================\n&#39; RELACIONES DEL ESTUDIANTE\n&#39; ============================================\n\n&#39; Autenticación (sin login requerido)\nEstudiante --&gt; REG\nEstudiante --&gt; REC\nEstudiante --&gt; LOG\nEstudiante --&gt; CERR\n\n&#39; Acceso a módulos (requiere login)\nEstudiante --&gt; ACC_E\nACC_E ..&gt; LOG : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n\n&#39; Dashboard incluye acceso a módulos\nDASH ..&gt; ACC_E : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n\n&#39; Módulos del estudiante (requieren acceso)\nACC_E ..&gt; BUS : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nACC_E ..&gt; FIC : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nACC_E ..&gt; COM : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nACC_E ..&gt; TES : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nACC_E ..&gt; RES : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nACC_E ..&gt; MAP : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nACC_E ..&gt; PER : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nACC_E ..&gt; DASH : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n\n&#39; ============================================\n&#39; RELACIONES ENTRE FUNCIONALIDADES\n&#39; ============================================\n\n&#39; Visualizar Ficha incluye Buscar Carreras\nFIC ..&gt; BUS : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n\n&#39; Ver Resultados extiende Realizar Test Vocacional\nRES ..&gt; TES : &lt;&lt;extend&gt;&gt;\n\n&#39; ============================================\n&#39; RELACIONES DEL ADMINISTRADOR\n&#39; ============================================\n\n&#39; Autenticación (sin login requerido)\nAdmin --&gt; REG\nAdmin --&gt; REC\nAdmin --&gt; LOG\nAdmin --&gt; CERR\n\n&#39; Acceso a administración (requiere login)\nAdmin --&gt; ACC_A\nACC_A ..&gt; LOG : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n\n&#39; Módulos del administrador (requieren acceso)\nACC_A ..&gt; ADM_USR : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nACC_A ..&gt; ADM_EST : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nACC_A ..&gt; DASH_ADM : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nACC_A ..&gt; REP : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nACC_A ..&gt; GES : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n\n&#39; Relaciones entre funcionalidades\nDASH_ADM ..&gt; ACC_A : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nREP ..&gt; ADM_EST : &lt;&lt;extend&gt;&gt;\n\n&#39; ============================================\n&#39; RESTRICCIONES Y NOTAS\n&#39; ============================================\nnote top of LOG\n  **Requisito obligatorio:**\n  Todos los usuarios deben\n  iniciar sesión para acceder\n  a cualquier funcionalidad\nend note\n\n&#39; ============================================\n&#39; LEYENDA\n&#39; ============================================\nlegend right\n  | &lt;back:#D4E6F1&gt;  &lt;/back&gt; | Casos de uso del Estudiante |\n  | &lt;back:#FADBD8&gt;  &lt;/back&gt; | Casos de uso del Administrador |\n  | &lt;back:#FDEBD0&gt;  &lt;/back&gt; | Casos de uso de Autenticación |\n  | &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt; | Inclusión obligatoria |\n  | &lt;&lt;extend&gt;&gt; | Extensión opcional |\nendlegend\n\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;format&quot;: &quot;svg&quot;&#xa;}" id="Fk61ovNkhSbToO5wZgjk-1">
          <mxCell parent="1" style="shape=image;noLabel=1;verticalAlign=top;aspect=fixed;imageAspect=0;image=data:image/svg+xml,;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry height="1900" width="1122" x="1390" y="5660" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
