        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&quot;data&quot;:&quot;@startuml \&quot;Diagrama de Uso - Mapa Interactivo\&quot;\nleft to right direction\nskinparam packageStyle rectangle\nskinparam actorStyle awesome\n\n&#39; ============================================\n&#39; COLORES\n&#39; ============================================\nskinparam usecaseBackgroundColor #D4E6F1\nskinparam usecaseBorderColor #1A5276\n\n&#39; ============================================\n&#39; ACTOR\n&#39; ============================================\nactor \&quot;Estudiante\&quot; as Estudiante\n\n&#39; ============================================\n&#39; PORTAL ELIGE TU FUTURO\n&#39; ============================================\nrectangle \&quot;Mapa Interactivo\&quot; {\n  \n  usecase \&quot;Consultar Mapa Educativo\&quot; as MAP\n  usecase \&quot;Ver Sedes en tu Zona\&quot; as VER\n  usecase \&quot;Filtrar por Radio de Distancia\&quot; as FIL_RADIO\n  usecase \&quot;Ver Nombre de la Sede\&quot; as NOM\n  usecase \&quot;Ver Institución de la Sede\&quot; as INST\n  usecase \&quot;Ver Distancia de la Sede\&quot; as DIST\n  usecase \&quot;Seleccionar una Sede\&quot; as SEL\n  usecase \&quot;Ver Carreras en la Sede\&quot; as CARR\n  \n}\n\n&#39; ============================================\n&#39; RELACIONES\n&#39; ============================================\nEstudiante --&gt; MAP\n\nMAP ..&gt; VER : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nMAP ..&gt; FIL_RADIO : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n\nVER ..&gt; NOM : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nVER ..&gt; INST : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nVER ..&gt; DIST : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nVER ..&gt; SEL : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n\nSEL ..&gt; CARR : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n\n@enduml&quot;,&quot;format&quot;:&quot;svg&quot;}" id="phteUvE2lu0CcGcIdKya-4">
